    {
      "text": "Banette generates energy for laying strong curses by sticking pins into its own body. This Pokémon was originally a pitiful plush doll that was thrown away.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "A cursed energy permeated the stuffing of a discarded and forgotten plush doll, giving it new life as Banette. The Pokémon’s energy would escape if it were to ever open its mouth.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s a stuffed toy that was thrown away and became possessed, ever searching for the one who threw it away so it can exact its revenge.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
